        "en": "Compassionate nurses alongside practice concerns"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently commend individual vets and nurses, particularly highlighting Emma and Georgia for their warmth, empathy, and sensitive support during end-of-life care. However, several reviewers report contrasting negative experiences with management, citing abrupt customer service, disputed billing queries, and inconsistent communication regarding treatment advice."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 9,
      "title": {
        "en": "Calming handling for anxious pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Multiple clients praise the team's gentle manner when examining pets, noting that staff take time to soothe nervous dogs, greet animals by name, and comfort cats during consultations. Reviewers appreciate that treatments and routine injections are administered without rushing, helping reduce pet stress during visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear explanations and emergency assistance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently value the prompt and clear communication provided by clinicians and receptionists during urgent appointments. Reviewers note that staff answer detailed questions about medications, explain surgical procedures thoroughly, and assist with immediate emergency scheduling, helping pet parents feel well supported when dealing with stressful health situations."
      }
    }
  ],
